  "description": "First-class System.Diagnostics.Metrics testing support for Compono - IMeterFactory composes naturally through UseMetrics(), backed by a hand-written CapturingMeterFactory that captures counter, up-down-counter, histogram, gauge, and observable measurements per factory (scope-isolated, thread-safe, typed, no boxing) and offers Compono-native Verify<T>() verification reusing core CallVerifier unmodified. No dependency beyond core Compono. See docs/adr/0072-compono-metrics-testing-support-package.md.",
